  "description": "Dabbler Access Harvester CLI. Harvests Microsoft Access (.accdb/.mdb) metadata — forms, reports, queries, macros, ribbons, tables, modules — into structured JSON a downstream AI can interpret and document. The extract/run/report-baseline subcommands are COM-based and require Windows + Microsoft Access; parse/translate/generate-docs/validate/generate-migration are file-to-file and run anywhere the .NET 10 runtime does.",
